  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec810658681aef64daf163b006389223, type: 3}
  m_Name: ArtMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NPCName: John
  lines:
  - Hi there, a warm welcome to our art gallery! My name is John and I am a virtual
    staff member here, alongside Veronica.
  - Our art gallery is a great location to host your future art shows, digital exhibitions
    or live events. Do take a look around to see if this space fits your needs.
  - My dialogue can be customized and I can be placed anywhere inside the space to
    talk about your organization and offerings. As virtual staff, I am around 24/7
    to facilitate an enjoyable experience for every user.
  - You may click on the magnifying glass on the top right of the art pieces to view
    more details.
  - Feel free to take a seat on the benches if you need a short break, and I hope
    you enjoy your visit.
  audioClips: []
  choice: {fileID: 0}
